00:12:12.398 --> 00:12:15.067
You're the one who said you wanted
to have a hotpot today,

00:12:15.067 --> 00:12:17.865
and you're also the reason why
we had to cancel it.

00:12:18.170 --> 00:12:20.039
Don't you feel bad for pushing
her around all the time?

00:12:20.039 --> 00:12:21.307
No, I don't !

00:12:21.307 --> 00:12:22.641
Well, you should at least a little!

00:12:22.641 --> 00:12:23.375
Here.

00:12:23.375 --> 00:12:23.709
HUH?
Here.

00:12:23.709 --> 00:12:24.176
HUH?

00:12:24.176 --> 00:12:24.443
HUH?
Don't give me that!

00:12:24.443 --> 00:12:25.410
Don't give me that!

00:12:26.312 --> 00:12:27.836
Argh...

00:12:30.015 --> 00:12:31.642
Thank you for the food.

00:12:35.087 --> 00:12:36.554
It's good.

00:12:37.423 --> 00:12:39.692
But we have to wait for Daddy
to come home first!

00:12:39.692 --> 00:12:42.490
I hope Daddy comes home soon!

00:12:43.028 --> 00:12:45.496
That's nice, isn't it?

00:12:47.833 --> 00:12:49.630
I see you're eating well!

00:12:52.171 --> 00:12:55.538
I don't have any food to feed you!

00:12:56.976 --> 00:13:00.844
I've already had an excellent meal,
so I don't need crap like this!

00:13:00.946 --> 00:13:05.406
Here, it's foie gras something and
boeuf something-or-other. Eat it.

00:13:05.651 --> 00:13:06.919
No thanks!

00:13:06.919 --> 00:13:12.224
What? After I came all the way into this
scary ass room to deliver it straight to you?

00:13:12.224 --> 00:13:14.249
Do you have anything else to say?

00:13:17.296 --> 00:13:21.600
Do you really enjoy eating all alone
in a room like this?

00:13:21.600 --> 00:13:23.033
Just leave me alone.

00:13:23.102 --> 00:13:23.335
Snap

00:13:23.335 --> 00:13:23.435
Snap
Okay, fine! Well, good for you then!

00:13:23.435 --> 00:13:25.801
Okay, fine! Well, good for you then!

00:13:26.205 --> 00:13:29.402
You didn't have to go out of your way
and cook our meal.

00:13:37.716 --> 00:13:39.013
Finishing touch!

00:13:39.718 --> 00:13:41.583
Get out of my room!

00:13:44.590 --> 00:13:47.126
Hey, did Sunako like it?

00:13:47.126 --> 00:13:48.460
Think I give a damn?!

00:13:48.460 --> 00:13:50.428
He must've said something to her, again.

00:13:51.030 --> 00:13:53.499
Ni ghttime

00:13:53.499 --> 00:13:55.126
Daytime

00:13:55.334 --> 00:13:59.930
I think I've got indigestion because
I ate too much yesterday!

00:14:00.339 --> 00:14:02.508
Hey, where's Kyohei?

00:14:02.508 --> 00:14:04.976
He went out somewhere this morning.

00:14:05.444 --> 00:14:07.646
Oh, hi, Sunako!

00:14:07.646 --> 00:14:11.207
We don't have to work tonight,
so please cook dinner. Okay?!

00:14:11.684 --> 00:14:14.353
We have only a few ingredients
on hand though.

00:14:14.353 --> 00:14:16.488
You think we can do a hotpot?

00:14:16.488 --> 00:14:18.581
Hotpot?

00:14:18.891 --> 00:14:21.594
I think Kyohei's been yearning for that.

00:14:21.594 --> 00:14:22.761
Yearning?

00:14:22.761 --> 00:14:24.563
He came from a family with certain issues,

00:14:24.563 --> 00:14:27.900
so he's never gotten to experience something
like sitting down at the table with his family

00:14:27.900 --> 00:14:29.902
and enjoying a hotpot together.

00:14:29.902 --> 00:14:31.070
Me either.

00:14:31.070 --> 00:14:33.005
What? Seriously?

00:14:33.005 --> 00:14:36.008
So I know this is a pain for you, Sunako,

00:14:36.008 --> 00:14:39.967
but to tell you the truth I really enjoy
having dinner here with all five of us.

00:14:40.346 --> 00:14:42.514
Actually, I do too!

00:14:42.514 --> 00:14:44.948
So, I can kind of understand how he feels.

00:14:45.284 --> 00:14:50.278
Hotpot or not, I wonder if Kyohei ever
had any meals with his family?

00:14:53.826 --> 00:14:55.293
I'll go buy some groceries.

00:15:03.369 --> 00:15:06.105
Young man, that should be
enough for the potatoes!

00:15:06.105 --> 00:15:08.507
Now do the daikon radishes!
Just do the whole row right there!

00:15:08.507 --> 00:15:11.635
That old fart, he's a slave driver!

00:15:11.744 --> 00:15:13.178
Did you say something?

00:15:13.178 --> 00:15:14.413
Nothing!

00:15:14.413 --> 00:15:19.752
You sure have been a big help, I'll tell ya!

00:15:19.752 --> 00:15:21.820
My back's been killing me, you know!

00:15:21.820 --> 00:15:25.187
I'll help you, but don't forget to give me
some free veggies in return!

00:15:26.358 --> 00:15:27.290
Ow!

00:15:29.361 --> 00:15:33.666
Say, young man, you don't like carrots?

00:15:33.666 --> 00:15:34.900
Nope!

00:15:34.900 --> 00:15:38.961
That creepy girl is extremely careful
when it comes to picking carrots!

00:15:39.071 --> 00:15:39.338
Hmm...

00:15:39.338 --> 00:15:41.173
Hmm...
I bet she gets that way when she shops

00:15:41.173 --> 00:15:44.243
Hmm...
because she thinks about the
preferences of the people she feeds.

00:15:44.243 --> 00:15:44.276
because she thinks about the
preferences of the people she feeds.

00:15:44.276 --> 00:15:47.905
I always thought that whenever
I saw her doing it.

