Well, at first I thought a ghost was
stopping by my shop though!

00:15:50.582 --> 00:15:52.418
Excuse me...
Well, at first I thought a ghost was
stopping by my shop though!

00:15:52.418 --> 00:15:52.952
Well, at first I thought a ghost was
stopping by my shop though!

00:15:52.952 --> 00:15:54.249
Me too.

