SHOPPING ARCADE

00:15:59.625 --> 00:16:01.460
Ingredients for the hotpot...
Ingredients for the hotpot...

00:16:01.460 --> 00:16:03.262
Kotatsu... Kotatsu...

00:16:03.262 --> 00:16:04.559
Ingredients for...

