Creepy girl! Aren't you stopping by today?

00:16:07.066 --> 00:16:08.067
No...

00:16:08.067 --> 00:16:12.571
I heard that you didn't get to do
the hotpot last night, eh?

00:16:12.571 --> 00:16:14.740
What? Is that right?

00:16:14.740 --> 00:16:15.866
Actually, yes...

00:16:16.141 --> 00:16:18.210
Sorry to hear that!

00:16:18.210 --> 00:16:20.346
If you don't mind, I'll give you some scraps!

00:16:20.346 --> 00:16:22.948
Yeah, take some from us too!

00:16:22.948 --> 00:16:26.885
Thanks to you and the other guy, the number
of our customers tripled yesterday!

00:16:26.885 --> 00:16:30.343
Hey, Tofu Shop!
You should give her something too!

00:16:30.589 --> 00:16:31.223
Sure! You want one or two?

00:16:31.223 --> 00:16:32.358
Sure!
Sure! You want one or two?

00:16:32.358 --> 00:16:32.591
Sure! You want one or two?

00:16:32.591 --> 00:16:35.561
One is fine! Thank you so much!

00:16:35.561 --> 00:16:37.426
Don't worry about it!

