some work around here sometimes!

00:17:21.140 --> 00:17:22.505
Sure thing!

00:17:26.712 --> 00:17:29.044
But we have to wait for Daddy
to come home first!

00:17:29.681 --> 00:17:32.707
I hope Daddy comes home soon!

00:17:32.918 --> 00:17:35.409
That's nice, isn't it?

00:17:36.088 --> 00:17:37.756
He came from a family with certain issues,

00:17:37.756 --> 00:17:40.225
so he never got to experience something like
sitting down at the table with his family

00:17:40.225 --> 00:17:41.783
and enjoying a hotpot together.

