Maybe it's just me,

00:17:49.134 --> 00:17:51.762
but why does she look like she's nailing
a straw doll to a tree or something?

00:17:53.939 --> 00:17:55.507
I guess it snowed a lot.

00:17:55.507 --> 00:17:58.203
Hey, stop eating only the meat!

00:17:58.444 --> 00:17:59.445
Huh?

00:17:59.445 --> 00:18:00.878
But!

00:18:01.080 --> 00:18:04.283
Veggies, veggies, veggies, meat,
veggies, veggies!

00:18:04.283 --> 00:18:06.785
Hey, the enoki mushrooms aren't gone yet!

00:18:06.785 --> 00:18:10.084
Honey, you're such a hotpot despot!

00:18:13.692 --> 00:18:15.294
Hey, look at that.

00:18:15.294 --> 00:18:18.063
I can't believe someone left trash
like that in the road.

00:18:18.063 --> 00:18:20.165
Maybe I should call city hall.

00:18:20.165 --> 00:18:22.668
Do they usually charge
recycle taxes on a kotatsu?

00:18:22.668 --> 00:18:24.036
I'm not sure...

00:18:24.036 --> 00:18:27.096
Ko.. Ko.. Ko... Kotatsu!

00:18:31.910 --> 00:18:32.878
Urgh!

