00:18:42.020 --> 00:18:43.487
But anyway...

00:18:44.323 --> 00:18:47.486
Check it out! It's one good-looking kotatsu!

00:18:48.026 --> 00:18:49.862
Where did you buy it?

00:18:49.862 --> 00:18:50.829
Huh?

00:18:51.763 --> 00:18:54.732
Don't tell me you actually made this?

00:18:55.534 --> 00:18:56.728
Y.. Yeah...

00:18:57.803 --> 00:19:00.601
I really think you go overboard with things.

00:19:01.340 --> 00:19:03.675
I don't wanna hear that from you!

00:19:03.675 --> 00:19:05.074
What is that?!

00:19:05.844 --> 00:19:08.142
For the record, I didn't steal them!

00:19:15.554 --> 00:19:16.680
Hey...

00:19:18.924 --> 00:19:20.323
Let me see that.

00:19:26.999 --> 00:19:28.500
You know it's fun.

00:19:28.500 --> 00:19:29.626
Hmm?

00:19:29.768 --> 00:19:31.770
Eating a hotpot around a kotatsu table.

00:19:31.770 --> 00:19:32.794
Yeah!

00:19:33.539 --> 00:19:35.666
Hey, where did those two go?

00:19:35.908 --> 00:19:38.377
I brought this big earthen pot and all!

00:19:38.377 --> 00:19:40.445
I'm so hungry!

00:19:40.445 --> 00:19:43.414
Yeah, you're right.
It's just taking them too long.

00:19:43.849 --> 00:19:47.052
Ranmaru, let's split up and go find them.

00:19:47.052 --> 00:19:48.076
Okay!

00:19:48.420 --> 00:19:50.115
It's snowing so be careful!

00:19:55.861 --> 00:19:58.197
BI.. BI.. Blanket!

00:19:58.197 --> 00:20:00.757
Co.. Co.. Cocoa! Make it really hot!

00:20:02.634 --> 00:20:03.702
Awake now?

00:20:03.702 --> 00:20:04.636
What?

00:20:04.636 --> 00:20:05.871
What do you think?

00:20:05.871 --> 00:20:09.041
We got an advance loan from the restaurant,
and put some sliding doors in the house!

00:20:09.041 --> 00:20:10.235
We got padded kimonos too!

00:20:11.777 --> 00:20:13.378
Kotatsu!

00:20:13.378 --> 00:20:15.681
You guys bought a really nice one!

00:20:15.681 --> 00:20:19.242
Get this! It's made by Sunako Nakahara!

00:20:20.319 --> 00:20:21.587
You're kidding...

00:20:21.587 --> 00:20:24.122
That's awesome! You're a genius, Sunako!

00:20:24.122 --> 00:20:27.455
That's amazing!
You're a super genius, Sunako!

00:20:27.993 --> 00:20:32.657
Hey, Sunako, a year-end gift was
delivered to your aunt.

00:20:33.098 --> 00:20:33.832
Huh?

00:20:33.832 --> 00:20:34.099
Bluefin Tuna
Huh?

00:20:34.099 --> 00:20:35.691
Bluefin Tuna

00:20:36.034 --> 00:20:39.404
Let's eat it! Let's eat it!
Come on, slice the fish!

00:20:39.404 --> 00:20:40.606
Kyohei!

00:20:40.606 --> 00:20:43.041
There's no need to force yourself, Sunako.

00:20:43.041 --> 00:20:46.678
It must've been a lot of work, always
cooking for all of us all this time.

00:20:46.678 --> 00:20:48.873
I'll come help as much as I can too!

00:20:49.448 --> 00:20:51.817
We'll learn how to cook at work too!

00:20:51.817 --> 00:20:52.884
Kyohei will learn too!

00:20:52.884 --> 00:20:53.748
What?

00:20:54.152 --> 00:20:56.950
