Bluefin Tuna
You're so cool!

00:21:10.135 --> 00:21:11.602
It's so good!

00:21:11.903 --> 00:21:13.871
You gotta have a hotpot in the winter!

00:21:14.239 --> 00:21:16.241
Forget foie gras!

00:21:16.241 --> 00:21:18.810
There's nothing better than a hotpot that
you eat with your friends, right?

00:21:18.810 --> 00:21:20.277
Yeah, I agree!

00:21:21.280 --> 00:21:23.849
Kyohei, aren't you gonna be
the hotpot despot?

00:21:23.849 --> 00:21:25.284
Oh, that's right!

00:21:25.284 --> 00:21:27.185
Back off!

00:21:27.185 --> 00:21:32.090
The meat and fish are mine!
And the rest of you eat the veggies!

00:21:32.090 --> 00:21:34.293
A real hotpot despot wouldn't talk like that!

00:21:34.293 --> 00:21:35.827
No?

00:21:35.827 --> 00:21:37.454
Hey, don't you put carrots in there!

00:21:37.763 --> 00:21:40.265
But the flower-shaped carrots are
essential to a hotpot!

00:21:40.265 --> 00:21:42.534
Put more fish! Shrimp! Put more shrimp!

00:21:42.534 --> 00:21:43.592
Yeah, yeah...

00:21:47.939 --> 00:21:49.341
What's the matter?

00:21:49.341 --> 00:21:50.976
They look cute together, huh?

00:21:50.976 --> 00:21:52.711
Yeah, you're right.

00:21:52.711 --> 00:21:54.975
Hey, that's my meat!

00:21:56.281 --> 00:21:58.116
The mushrooms are done already, right?

00:21:58.116 --> 00:21:59.718
Pass me the soy sauce!
